The leaker known as "<a href="https://weibo.com/5143897135/5368037688477363">Instant Digital</a>" said in a new post on Weibo that Samsung's advantages in crease control, reliability, and manufacturing yields would make it very difficult for LG Display to enter the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a>'s foldable display supply chain.<br/>
<br/>
